  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Link microscopy images to a plate or evidence map and an independent endpoint, measure a treatment effect, challenge it with QC exclusion, leave-one-replicate-out, label permutation and cross-modality comparison, return a cautious verdict with exportable evidence, and separately observe a microscope video on its own without a plate map. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
